== verdict notes ==
On real NS, none of the TF/B kernels is a term in the vorticity equation.
The IBP identity leaves only INT w.Sw - nu||grad w||^2 in the enstrophy balance.
A -k M^3 sink is therefore not produced by TF on real NS solutions.
